{"ID":"20240205153726-jbnobi5","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240205153726-jbnobi5","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205153726-jbnobi5\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206115332-fisl4zs\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240619185719-algnmi5\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:1884,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240619185814-vn5kct9\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:4,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:4\u0026#125;","title":"山楂","type":"doc","updated":"20240830165908"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206102814-8voav4s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206102814-8voav4s","updated":"20240206102825"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产河南、河北、山东等地。\n【性状】\t果实较小，类球形，直径0.8"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"~"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.4cm，有的压成饼状。表面棕色至棕红色，并有细密皱纹，顶端凹陷，有花萼残迹，基部有果梗或已脱落。\n【性味】\t甘、酸，微温。\n【功效】\t开胃消食、化滞消积、活血散瘀、化痰行气。用于肉食滞积、症瘕积聚、腹胀痞满、瘀阻腹痛、痰饮、泄泻、肠风下血等。\n【炙品】\t炒山楂：取净山楂，置炒制容器内，用中火加热，炒至颜色加深，取出放凉。能够缓和药性。\n焦山楂：取净山楂，置炒制容器内，用中火加热，炒至外表焦褐色，内部焦黄色，取出放凉。主治疗秋季腹泻，气清香，味酸、微涩。\n山楂炭：取净山楂，置炒制容器内，用武火加热，炒至表面焦黑色，内部焦褐色，取出放凉。具有止血功能。"}]},{"ID":"20240717185402-qsp7w47","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240717185402-qsp7w47","updated":"20240717185406"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206102815-u9kx6j9.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 511px;","style":"width: 501px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"山楂 (4)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/山楂 4-20240712145949-2s50qfc.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 501px;\" parent-style=\"width: 511px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240619185754-f8z2pwb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240619185754-f8z2pwb","updated":"20240717190054"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 414px;","style":"width: 404px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"山楂"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/山楂-20240205162247-780m1qy.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 404px;\" parent-style=\"width: 414px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 628px;","style":"width: 618px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"山楂 (22)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/山楂 22-20240717190054-73d2znx.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 618px;\" parent-style=\"width: 628px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240717185510-gbydnsn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240717185510-gbydnsn","updated":"20240717185510"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 654px;","style":"width: 644px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"山楂"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/山楂-20240712145811-d837czt.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 644px;\" parent-style=\"width: 654px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImag